# The Eight Accumulators ("Keen 9.5": Bubbatom, 2011) as a Keen Worlds world.
# Written by tools/kw_accumulators.py from the mod's CKPatch file; the data
# files beside it are the player's copy of the mod. It runs on Keen 4.

%string ca_tileInfo "KEEN4.TLI"

