	"Keen treks around\nAspermontis",
	"Keen crunches through\nDusty Fort",
	"Keen ticks over\nPyramid of Time",
	"Keen pays a visits\nto The Oracle",
	"Keen fades into\nThe Perspicuus City",
	"Keen gets lost in\nThe Damp Woods",
	"Keen swoops into\nThe Blue Bird Caves",
	"Keen contemplates on\nVitrium",
	"Keen blinks\nin and out of existance\nin Defluo",
	"Keen boils in\nPyramid of Heat",
	"Keen seeps into\nThe Lichen Caves",
	"Keen creeps into\nGnosticene Village",
	"Keen blindly enters\nThe Pyramid of Light",
	"Keen approaches\nFootsville",
	"Keen wades through the\nDesert Creek",
